ype="Text" class="sc-bjzvwx pf-119_">Wine packages are shipped out to our members twice a year in March and October. You will receive an email notification prior to each shipment.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-edEPsa pf-120_"><button type="button" class="sc-hkgvIF cRCYpS pf-121_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="911bb116-89eb-4b9b-beda-25819e199414" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Billing</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="911bb116-89eb-4b9b-beda-25819e199414" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-bSqcWw bemmcV pf-123_"><div class="sc-dtDNCR pf-124_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-125_"><p class="sc-hmvloj hXoyMC pf-126_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-bjzvwx pf-128_">As a member of the wine club, you will be billed at the begining of each month prior to shipping (March and October) until you cancel (subject to a minimum of 2 shipments.)</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-edEPsa pf-129_"><button type="button" class="sc-hkgvIF cRCYpS pf-130_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="da25819e-1994-442b-8744-2648c592147b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span>Still unsure?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="da25819e-1994-442b-8744-2648c592147b" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-bSqcWw bemmcV pf-132_"><div class="sc-dtDNCR pf-133_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-kTqJeW gAbfRg pf-134_"><p class="sc-hmvloj hXoyMC pf-135_